const activeColors={orbitDamage:'#ff8f70',orbitHeal:'#9cf2a3',radialPhysical:'#e5c88b',radialElement:'#9ee9ff',damagePulse:'#ff7b9f',healPulse:'#8ff0b3',guardianShot:'#ffe56d',boomerangBurst:'#d8c7ff',chainNova:'#77dfff',shieldWave:'#8bbcff'};
function activeItemInterval(def,strength=1){const p=(def.power||1)*itemPowerMultiplier,boost=1+Math.log2(Math.max(1,strength))*.3;return({orbitHeal:Math.max(2.8,(7.5-p*.45)/boost),radialPhysical:Math.max(2.2,(7-p*.45)/boost),radialElement:Math.max(2.1,(6.6-p*.4)/boost),damagePulse:Math.max(2.2,(7.2-p*.45)/boost),healPulse:Math.max(3,(9-p*.5)/boost),guardianShot:Math.max(.45,(2-p*.18)/boost),boomerangBurst:Math.max(2.1,(6.4-p*.4)/boost),chainNova:Math.max(2.1,(7-p*.4)/boost),shieldWave:Math.max(2.8,(9-p*.45)/boost)}[def.active]||1);}
function activeEffectArt(type){const active=itemTypes[type]?.active;return({orbitHeal:'heal',healPulse:'heal',damagePulse:'damage-pulse',radialPhysical:'hit',radialElement:'freeze',guardianShot:'hit',boomerangBurst:'speed',chainNova:'chain',shieldWave:'shield'}[active]||'hit');}
function addEffectWave(type,color,radius){effectWaves.push({x:player.x,y:player.y,type,effect:activeEffectArt(type),color,radius,life:.7,maxLife:.7});}
function launchActiveProjectile(def,x,y,angle,damage,options={}){const projectile=makeProjectile({speed:options.speed||640,range:options.range||700,projectile:def.projectile,returning:!!options.returning,homing:options.homing||0,pierce:options.pierce||0,blast:options.blast||0},x,y,angle,damage);projectile.item=true;projectile.r=options.r||7;return addBullet(projectile);}
function healFromActive(type,amount,color='#9cf2a3'){const before=player.hp;player.hp=Math.min(player.maxHp,player.hp+amount);const healed=Math.ceil(player.hp-before);if(healed>0){floatText(player.x,player.y-78,`+${healed} HP`,color,18);showEffect('heal',player.x,player.y,82,.55);}addEffectWave(type,color,130);}
function updateActiveItems(dt){
 for(const wave of effectWaves)wave.life-=dt;effectWaves=effectWaves.filter(wave=>wave.life>0);for(const link of effectLinks)link.life-=dt;effectLinks=effectLinks.filter(link=>link.life>0);
 const strengths={};for(const item of itemStacks())if(itemTypes[item.type]?.active)strengths[item.type]=(strengths[item.type]||0)+itemStackPower(item.level);for(const type of Object.keys(activeItemStates))if(!strengths[type])delete activeItemStates[type];
 const activeTypes=Object.keys(strengths),damageScale=player.damage*(player.damageBoostTimer>0?1+player.damageBoost:1);
 for(let order=0;order<activeTypes.length;order++){
  const type=activeTypes[order],def=itemTypes[type],strength=strengths[type],p=(def.power||1)*itemPowerMultiplier,number=Number(type.slice(1)),interval=activeItemInterval(def,strength),state=activeItemStates[type]||=( {cool:Math.min(1.25,interval*.3)+(number%5)*.07,phase:(number*2.399)%TAU,hitTimes:new WeakMap(),visible:false} );state.cool-=dt;state.visible=['orbitDamage','orbitHeal','guardianShot'].includes(def.active);
  if(state.visible){const radius=76+(number%4)*20,direction=number%2?-1:1,angle=state.phase+worldTime*(1.15+(number%3)*.13)*direction;state.x=player.x+Math.cos(angle)*radius;state.y=player.y+Math.sin(angle)*radius;state.angle=angle;}
  if(def.active==='orbitDamage'){for(const enemy of enemies){if(enemy.hp<=0||!enemyVisible(enemy)||distance(state,enemy)>=enemy.r+24)continue;const next=state.hitTimes.get(enemy)||0;if(worldTime<next)continue;state.hitTimes.set(enemy,worldTime+.58);damageEnemy(enemy,(5+p*2)*strength*damageScale,{item:true,active:type});}continue;}
  if(state.cool>0)continue;state.cool=interval;const color=activeColors[def.active]||'#d1f56b';
  if(def.active==='orbitHeal')healFromActive(type,(1+Math.ceil(p/2))*strength,color);
  else if(def.active==='radialPhysical'||def.active==='radialElement'){const count=Math.floor((def.active==='radialPhysical'?4:5)+p+Math.log2(strength)),damage=(def.active==='radialPhysical'?4+p*2:5+p*2.2)*strength*damageScale;for(let i=0;i<count;i++)launchActiveProjectile(def,player.x,player.y,worldTime+i/count*TAU,damage,{speed:610+(number%3)*45,pierce:strength>=3?1:0,blast:def.active==='radialElement'&&strength>=3?34:0});addEffectWave(type,color,155);}
  else if(def.active==='damagePulse'){const radius=165+p*18+Math.log2(strength)*18;affectNearby(radius,enemy=>damageEnemy(enemy,(8+p*4)*strength*damageScale,{item:true,active:type}));addEffectWave(type,color,radius);}
  else if(def.active==='healPulse')healFromActive(type,(2+p)*strength,color);
  else if(def.active==='guardianShot'){const target=nearestVisibleEnemy(state,720);if(target){const angle=Math.atan2(target.y-state.y,target.x-state.x);launchActiveProjectile(def,state.x,state.y,angle,(7+p*3)*strength*damageScale,{speed:760,homing:.06,pierce:strength>=3?1:0});addEffectWave(type,color,90);}}
  else if(def.active==='boomerangBurst'){const count=1+Math.ceil(p/2)+Math.floor(Math.log2(strength));for(let i=0;i<count;i++)launchActiveProjectile(def,player.x,player.y,worldTime+i/count*TAU,(8+p*3)*strength*damageScale,{speed:590,range:520,returning:true,pierce:1});addEffectWave(type,color,145);}
  else if(def.active==='chainNova'){const targets=enemies.filter(enemy=>enemy.hp>0&&enemyVisible(enemy)&&distance(player,enemy)<470).sort((a,b)=>distance(player,a)-distance(player,b)).slice(0,Math.floor(2+p+Math.log2(strength)));let from={x:player.x,y:player.y};for(const target of targets){damageEnemy(target,(6+p*3)*strength*damageScale,{item:true,active:type});effectLinks.push({x1:from.x,y1:from.y,x2:target.x,y2:target.y,color,life:.28,maxLife:.28});from=target;}addEffectWave(type,color,125);}
  else if(def.active==='shieldWave'){gainShield(player,(1+p)*strength);const radius=180+p*16+Math.log2(strength)*18;for(const enemy of enemies){const dx=enemy.x-player.x,dy=enemy.y-player.y,d=Math.hypot(dx,dy)||1;if(enemy.hp>0&&d<radius){const push=(28+p*7)*Math.sqrt(strength);enemy.x=clamp(enemy.x+dx/d*push,20,activeWorldWidth()-20);enemy.y=clamp(enemy.y+dy/d*push,20,activeWorldHeight()-20);}}addEffectWave(type,color,radius);}
 }
}
function splitRecoveredMaterials(total){const ids=Object.keys(crewMaterials),whole=Math.floor(total/ids.length),extra=total%ids.length;ids.forEach((id,index)=>crewMaterials[id]+=whole+(index<extra?1:0));return ids.map(id=>`${classes[id].name}: ${crewMaterials[id]}`).join(' · ');}
function deployEngineering(){structures=[];const engineering=Math.max(0,Math.floor(player.engineering||0)),count=Math.min(6,Math.ceil(engineering/4));for(let i=0;i<count;i++){const a=i/Math.max(1,count)*TAU-.6,range=105+(i%2)*38;structures.push({x:clamp(player.x+Math.cos(a)*range,35,activeWorldWidth()-35),y:clamp(player.y+Math.sin(a)*range,35,activeWorldHeight()-35),cool:rand(.15,.8),angle:a});}}
function updateStructures(dt){if(!structures.length)return;const engineering=player.engineering||0;for(const turret of structures){turret.cool-=dt;turret.flash=Math.max(0,(turret.flash||0)-dt);const target=nearestVisibleEnemy(turret,580);if(!target)continue;turret.angle=Math.atan2(target.y-turret.y,target.x-turret.x);if(turret.cool>0)continue;turret.cool=Math.max(.28,.92-engineering*.025);const def={speed:780,range:580,projectile:'thunder',engineering:true,pierce:Math.floor(engineering/12),blast:engineering>=8?36+engineering*2:0};addBullet(makeProjectile(def,turret.x+Math.cos(turret.angle)*42,turret.y+Math.sin(turret.angle)*42,turret.angle,6+engineering*1.8));turret.flash=.1;}}
function crewTreeBonus(){let bonus=Math.max(0,Math.floor(player?.treeBonus||0));if(onlineRole==='host')for(const member of onlineCrew.values())bonus+=Math.max(0,Math.floor(member.treeBonus||0));return bonus;}
function scaledWorldSpot(spot){return{x:spot.x/WORLD_W*activeWorldWidth(),y:spot.y/WORLD_H*activeWorldHeight()};}
function spawnTrees(){const count=clamp(3+crewTreeBonus(),3,treeSpawns.length),choices=sample(treeSpawns,count);trees=choices.map((spot,index)=>({...scaledWorldSpot(spot),r:48,size:225+(index%2)*18,rotation:rand(-.045,.045),hp:TREE_HEALTH,maxHp:TREE_HEALTH,hit:0,alive:true}));}
function deployFarms(){const count=Math.min(farmSpawns.length,Math.max(0,Math.floor(player.farmCapacity||0)));farms=farmSpawns.slice(0,count).map((spot,index)=>({...scaledWorldSpot(spot),r:58,size:235+(index%2)*10,rotation:index%2?.02:-.02,harvestClock:3+index*1.35}));}
function dropBasket(x,y){baskets.push({x:x+rand(-20,20),y:y+rand(-14,14),r:15,heal:5,phase:rand(0,TAU)});}
function damageTree(tree,damage){if(!tree?.alive)return false;tree.hp-=damage;tree.hit=.18;burst(tree.x,tree.y,'#a8c96d',4);if(tree.hp>0)return false;tree.alive=false;achievementStats.trees++;dropBasket(tree.x,tree.y);floatText(tree.x,tree.y-95,'AVOCADO BASKET','#d1f56b',17);burst(tree.x,tree.y,'#8cad5a',14);return true;}
function collectBasket(basket){player.hp=Math.min(player.maxHp,player.hp+5);collect({value:3},{basket:true});floatText(player.x,player.y-48,'+5 HP · ◆3','#f2d58c',20);showEffect('heal',basket.x,basket.y,78,.65);burst(basket.x,basket.y,'#d1f56b',8);beep(610,.09,'triangle',.025);}
function updateBaskets(dt){baskets=baskets.filter(basket=>{const d=distance(basket,player);if(d<30){collectBasket(basket);return false;}if(d<player.magnet){basket.x+=(player.x-basket.x)/(d||1)*300*dt;basket.y+=(player.y-basket.y)/(d||1)*300*dt;}return true;});}
function updateFarms(dt){const interval=Math.max(5,11-(player.harvesting||0)*.15);for(const farm of farms){farm.harvestClock-=dt;if(farm.harvestClock>0)continue;farm.harvestClock=interval;dropBasket(farm.x,farm.y+28);floatText(farm.x,farm.y-72,'BASKET READY','#d1f56b',16);}}
